# ==============================================================================
# VPJD GEOGRAPHY MODULE
# geography_06c1_validate_taxon_geographic_distribution.R
#
# PURPOSE
# -------
# Independently validate the canonical taxon x geographic-unit distribution
# and evidence products generated by:
#
#   geography_06c_build_taxon_geographic_distribution.R
#
#
# PRINCIPLE
# ---------
#
# This is a POST-BUILD validation script.
#
# It deliberately:
#
#   - starts from a clean analytical state;
#   - reads the release products back from disk;
#   - independently reads VPJD Taxonomic Release v1.0.0;
#   - independently reads the frozen VPJD Geography vocabulary;
#   - does NOT use objects created by 06c;
#   - does NOT rebuild the distribution from the analytical source matrix;
#   - does NOT alter any release product.
#
#
# PRODUCTS VALIDATED
# ------------------
#
#   vpjd_taxon_geographic_distribution_v1.0.0.csv
#
#   vpjd_taxon_geographic_evidence_v1.0.0.csv
#
#
# EXPECTED RELEASE STRUCTURE
# --------------------------
#
#   published recognised taxa                         12,037
#   frozen geographic concepts                          418
#   Japanese botanical areas                             51
#   WCVP/TDWG reference concepts                        367
#
#   complete analytical combination universe         613,887
#   positive taxon x area relationships              128,824
#   unsupported analytical combinations              485,063
#
#   taxa with positive geographic evidence            11,470
#   taxa without positive geographic evidence            567
#   Japanese botanical areas represented                  51
#
#
# EVIDENCE SEMANTICS
# ------------------
#
# Positive evidence in VPJD Geography v1.0.0 is:
#
#   n_occurrence_records > 0
#
# with:
#
#   n_unique_occurrences > 0
#
# required to agree for every published evidence relationship.
#
#
# IMPORTANT
# ---------
#
# Missing taxon x geographic-unit relationships are NOT interpreted as
# absences.
#
# The distribution product represents positive evidence only.
#
#
# THIS SCRIPT VALIDATES
# ---------------------
#
#   1. file existence;
#   2. required schemas;
#   3. expected cardinalities;
#   4. taxonomic foreign-key integrity;
#   5. geographic foreign-key integrity;
#   6. uniqueness of taxon x geographic-unit relationships;
#   7. positive-evidence semantics;
#   8. exact relationship agreement between distribution and evidence;
#   9. exact taxon coverage agreement;
#  10. exact geographic coverage agreement;
#  11. taxon names against VPJD Taxonomic Release v1.0.0;
#  12. geographic names/codes against the frozen vocabulary;
#  13. per-taxon geographic coverage;
#  14. per-area taxonomic coverage;
#  15. the set of 567 recognised taxa lacking positive geographic evidence;
#  16. release labels and status fields;
#  17. final release-readiness gate.
#
#
# THIS SCRIPT DOES NOT
# --------------------
#
#   - modify release products;
#   - regenerate identifiers;
#   - fuzzy-match names;
#   - infer absence;
#   - infer distribution from WCVP/TDWG reference geography;
#   - apply Nakamura logic;
#   - assign Star categories;
#   - infer endemicity;
#   - infer rarity.
#
# ==============================================================================


